url: 'https://python.openaq.org'
abstract: >-
  The OpenAQ Python SDK is the official Python client for
  interacting with the OpenAQ API. Compatible with Python
  ≥3.10, it is recommended over hand-written API access
  code, offering built-in best practices and features
  including: comprehensive type annotations with inline
  documentation for better IDE autocomplete; robust API
  validation with automatic checking of path and query
  parameters and clear, actionable error messages;
  deserialized response classes providing Python objects
  with attribute access, plus JSON and dictionary
  representation options; and automatic rate-limiting with
  expressive error handling that gracefully manages API
  limits.
